{"packageRef":{"id":"content.c.p05","version":"1.0.0"},"subject":{"id":"exercise.c.increment-at-index","version":"1.1.0","title":"指定元素加一","languageRef":{"id":"lang.c","version":"1.0.0"},"lessonRef":{"id":"lesson.c.array-update","version":"1.1.0"},"learningRevision":1,"acceptedPriorVersions":["1.0.1"],"knowledgeRefs":[{"id":"knowledge.c.arrays","version":"1.0.0"}],"programRef":{"id":"program.c.increment-at-index","version":"1.0.0"},"judgeRef":{"id":"judge.c.increment-at-index","version":"1.0.0"},"prompt":"输入数组values长度1到30、元素-999到999，指定下标k满足0<=k<n。保留输入绑定和逻辑长度，只把原指定位置values[k]加1，其他逻辑元素不变；输出改后元素和换行。必须实际读取并写回数组，不能只打印加1后的表达式。例如[4,0,-2]在k=1时变成[4,1,-2]并输出1；[999]在k=0时输出1000。判定核对退出前的数组与输出，全部测试正常结束且返回0。思路：读指定格子、加1、写回同一格子，再输出。","tests":[{"caseKey":"first","input":{"values":[4,0,-2],"k":0},"expectedStdout":"5\n","expectedExitCode":0,"expectedArray":[5,0,-2]},{"caseKey":"middle","input":{"values":[4,0,-2],"k":1},"expectedStdout":"1\n","expectedExitCode":0,"expectedArray":[4,1,-2]},{"caseKey":"last","input":{"values":[4,0,-2],"k":2},"expectedStdout":"-1\n","expectedExitCode":0,"expectedArray":[4,0,-1]},{"caseKey":"upper","input":{"values":[999],"k":0},"expectedStdout":"1000\n","expectedExitCode":0,"expectedArray":[1000]},{"caseKey":"lower","input":{"values":[-999],"k":0},"expectedStdout":"-998\n","expectedExitCode":0,"expectedArray":[-998]}],"rewardRef":{"id":"reward.exercise.first-pass","version":"1.0.0"}},"program":{"id":"program.c.increment-at-index","version":"1.0.0","title":"数组指定元素加一参考","languageRef":{"id":"lang.c","version":"1.0.0"},"subsetRef":{"id":"subset.c.p0","version":"1.0.0"},"inputRef":{"id":"input.c.array-update","version":"1.0.0"},"exampleInput":{"values":[4,0,-2],"k":1},"sourceExample":"#include <stdio.h>\nint main(void) {\n    int n = 3;\n    int values[3] = {4, 0, -2};\n    int k = 1;\n    values[k] = values[k] + 1;\n    printf(\"%d\\n\", values[k]);\n    return 0;\n}\n","bindings":[{"bindingKey":"param.n","inputKey":"values","targetName":"n","targetKind":"logical-length","from":"length-of"},{"bindingKey":"param.values","inputKey":"values","targetName":"values","targetKind":"array","from":"field","emptyStorage":"one-zero-placeholder"},{"bindingKey":"param.k","inputKey":"k","targetName":"k","targetKind":"scalar","from":"field"}],"blockRefs":[{"id":"block.c.main","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"block.c.integer","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"block.c.declare-int","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"block.c.read-variable","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"block.c.arithmetic","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"block.c.declare-array","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"block.c.read-array","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"block.c.write-array","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"block.c.printf","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"block.c.return","version":"1.0.0"}],"reference":{"document":"../架构决策/01.3-正反样例清单.md","locator":"REF-05"}},"inputSpec":{"id":"input.c.array-update","version":"1.0.0","title":"非空数组和下标","fields":[{"key":"values","kind":"sequence","min":-999,"max":999,"minItems":1,"maxItems":30},{"key":"k","kind":"integer","min":0,"max":29}],"relations":[{"kind":"length-of","field":"values","target":"n"},{"kind":"index-in","field":"k","target":"values"}]},"judgeProfile":{"id":"judge.c.increment-at-index","version":"1.0.0","title":"单个数组目标检查","rule":"single-index-increment","targetDescription":"真实读写values[k]；main返回/销毁前观测目标+1、其余逻辑元素不变。"}}